text: ['Choose one —\\n• Target creature gains indestructible until end of turn. (Damage and effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy it.)\\n• Destroy target creature with toughness 4 or greater.', 'Flying\\nWhenever a Dragon you control attacks, bolster 2. (Choose a creature with the least toughness among creatures you control and put two +1/+1 counters on it.)', 'Prowess (Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, this creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\nWhenever you cast a noncreature spell, Seeker of the Way gains lifelink until end of turn.', 'Renown 1 (When this creature deals combat damage to a player, if it isn\'t renowned, put a +1/+1 counter on it and it becomes renowned.)\\nAs long as Honored Hierarch is renowned, it has vigilance and "{T}: Add one mana of any color."', 'Sandsteppe Citadel enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {W}, {B}, or {G}.', 'Trample\\nWhen Siege Rhino enters the battlefield, each opponent loses 3 life and you gain 3 life.']
flavor: ['"Every choice alters the path of fate."\\n—Sarkhan Vol', '"I don\'t know where my destiny lies, but I know it isn\'t here."', '"The bane of countless shattered weapons, each a failure to slay her."\\n—Daghatar the Adamant', 'That which endures, survives.', 'The mere approach of an Abzan war beast is enough to send enemies fleeing in panic.']
